# Not cruft -- do not "clean this up".
#
# This is an orphan branch holding only the Pages tree, so everything from the
# source branches (checkout/, tools/) appears as untracked when you switch to
# it. Without these entries, a `git clean -fd` while on gh-pages deletes the
# entire Chromium checkout.
#
# Caveat: this only stops `git clean -fd`. The -x flag deliberately ignores
# these rules, so `git clean -fdx` still removes checkout/. The only real
# protection is keeping the checkout outside the repo, which build.sh supports:
#   ROOT_PATH=/home/alex/electron-legacy-checkout ./build.sh x64
checkout/
tools/
